# Leaseweb deployment

1. Create an Ubuntu 24.04 Leaseweb instance.
2. Copy this directory with `deploy.sh user@host`.
3. Put Caddy or Traefik behind ports 80/443 for TLS.
4. Keep Postgres, RabbitMQ, SeaweedFS and management ports private.
5. Review AWS Lambda, IAM and CloudWatch findings before cut-over.

The generated credentials are in `secrets.env`; keep them out of Git and LLM prompts.
